        "content": "<p>I would like to do Advent of Code with Roc again this year.</p>\n<p>I plan to use the built-in echo platform. I really like the idea that all the code for a single day is contained in one file.</p>\n<p>A template could look like this:</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler-block\"><div class=\"spoiler-header\">\n<p>template file</p>\n</div><div class=\"spoiler-content\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"CoffeeScript\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"nx\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"day00.input\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">puzzle_input</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Str</span>\n\n<span class=\"nx\">main</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"nx\">args</span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nv\">result</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">match</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">parse_args</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">args</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"nx\">Part1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">day1</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">puzzle_input</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"nx\">Part2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">day2</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">puzzle_input</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"nx\">Both</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"s\">\"day1: ${day1(puzzle_input)?}\\n\\nday2:${day2(puzzle_input)?}\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"nx\">Help</span><span class=\"nf\">(message) =&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">message</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nx\">echo</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"${result}\\n\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nx\">Ok</span><span class=\"p\">({})</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"nv\">day1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"nx\">_input</span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nx\">Ok</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"day1 - TODO\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"nv\">day2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"nx\">_input</span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nx\">Ok</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"day2 - TODO\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"nv\">example_input</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"err\">\\\\</span><span class=\"nx\">Example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Input</span>\n\n<span class=\"nx\">expect</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nv\">got</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">day1</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">example_input</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nx\">got</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">example_input</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># expect {</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">#   got = day2(example_input)?</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">#</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">#   got == example_input</span>\n<span class=\"c1\"># }</span>\n\n<span class=\"nv\">parse_args</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"nx\">args</span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">args</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">contains</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"-h\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"nv\">message</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"err\">\\\\</span><span class=\"nx\">Solution</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">aoc2026</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"err\">\\</span><span class=\"o\">\\</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"err\">\\\\</span><span class=\"nx\">The</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">default</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">solution</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">both</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">parts</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">To</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">only</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">one</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">part</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">use</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">arguments</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">`</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">`</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">or</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">`</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">`</span><span class=\"p\">.</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"nx\">Help</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">message</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">args</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">contains</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"1\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"nx\">Part1</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">args</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">contains</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"2\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"nx\">Part2</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"nx\">Both</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n</div></div>\n<p>My repo will be <a href=\"https://github.com/ostcar/aoc2026\">here</a></p>\n<p>Are you also doing Advent of Code this year, or has it lost its appeal in the age of AI?</p>",
